Herdr Starship is based on Herdr Glass by Noah Chen
(https://github.com/noah4520/herdr-glass), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Noah Chen.
Herdr Starship's changes are under the same MIT License (LICENSE): the Starship
background as the default, the usage meters in mods/herdr-starship-pane, the bundled
font, extras/claude-statusline.sh and the documents.

Herdr Glass's own work, carried over here: the Appearance dialog
(mods/herdr-starship-bg), the preset background pictures, the theme, the install script.

These parts are derived from the Herdr app (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app,
defaults/), which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (licenses/Herdr-Apache-2.0.txt):

- layouts/herdr-starship.json, from Herdr's `main` layout (0.1.16): restyled as glass cards,
  with a background picture, its own theme and notifications mod.
- mods/herdr-starship-tabs, from `tabs` (0.1.16): no bottom border; the sidebar's
  spacing.
- mods/herdr-starship-pane, from `pane` (0.1.16): the header's content further in; the
  model and plan-usage meters for Claude Code panes.
- mods/herdr-starship-chrome, from `workspace-chrome` (0.1.16): an Appearance row in the
  footer; on the macOS rail, the fold button under the traffic lights.
- mods/herdr-starship-spaces, from `spaces` (0.1.16): no letter avatars.
- mods/herdr-starship-agents, from `agents` (0.1.16): grouped by space by default, the fold
  chevron after the group's name, no unfold button on the rail.
- mods/herdr-starship-status, from `workspace-status` (0.1.16): no top border line; text
  further in.
- mods/herdr-starship-toast, from `toast` (0.1.16): a colour bar by level, the agent's live
  title in the body.

Each of those mods' main.js starts with a note of what was changed.

